        "Id1": {
            "text": "The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument is in the United States in a place called the municipality of Gettysburg in Adams County, Pennsylvania. This place has to its southeast Carroll County, Maryland and to its north Pennsylvania's Cumberland County. The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument is classified as a contributing property."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument is located in the United States in the municipality of Gettysburg which is in Adams County, Pennsylvania. To the southeast of Adams County, Pennsylvania lies Carroll County, Maryland while to its north is Cumberland County, Pennsylvania. The monument falls under the category of Contributing property."
        },
